{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Dive into unpredictable horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under The Floor</strong> is a psychological fear simulator where every playthrough is unique\u2026 and every minute could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in an abandoned house, overrun by hostile entities.<br>Your goal: <strong>survive as long as you can</strong>, then attempt to cleanse the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing plays by the rules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f No playthrough is ever the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session generates a different combination of events, sounds, apparitions\u2014even the rules themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you think you\u2019ve learned won\u2019t help you next time.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities behave differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment turns hostile in new and unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t learn. You can only survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Run. Hide. Listen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is your instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide</strong> in the shadows.<br><strong>Listen</strong> for signs of movement.<br><strong>Anticipate</strong> what you don\u2019t yet understand.<br>Sometimes, <strong>running</strong> is your only option.<br>And sometimes\u2026 <strong>even running won\u2019t be enough.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude78 A psychological pressure cooker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under The Floor</strong> isn\u2019t just another horror game.<br>It\u2019s a nerve-wracking, unpredictable experience.<br>A true test of your mental endurance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd01 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Randomized events, sounds, and rules</strong> each time you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Unpredictable entities</strong> that adapt to your behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Constant tension</strong> without cheap jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Free exploration</strong> of an increasingly hostile house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>High replayability</strong> \u2014 no run is ever the same</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long will you last before you break?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720720/extras/782acfcf7d2d1517e98b271a1fdaa5d2.avif?t=1760441878\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Everything looks normal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720720/984c94020e538996df62d72e60634face547665d.jpg"},{"name":"Power\u2019s on!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720720/b0410f95313e7a3e491e49894b82d9abb8551b35.jpg"},{"name":"Aaaahhh!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720720/6aec72dbf240fe70145fae36fb2545e4bfa6d475.jpg"},{"name":"This could be useful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720720/2020468984d9dc6499113cc2d5a071723c45d82f.jpg"},{"name":"Oh no! Oh no!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720720/5325d60a9c432b23ff6633012094038c60a19e3c.jpg"},{"name":"A minute won\u2019t change much!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720720/3576f19d8b3ea43e3dbc8f919c1710da725578da.jpg"},{"name":"This house is perfectly